col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/07/91006211/4eb3fe145a19dca8d70a3718d8093b97_5211454384144986023.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">409</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">27</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在布洛妮娅接受了理之律者核心之后，那构造万物的能力也随着时间的推移，更为熟练地被她所掌握。而越是熟悉这份力量的她，也越是明白了这构造之力代表的无限可能。她将用这无限的可能性继续守护自己的同伴，守护自己的约定。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">天启蓝图\t\t\t\t\t</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">蓄力炮，一层：单发炮弹，二层：双发更强炮弹，3层：三发超强炮弹。角色造成的冰冻元素伤害提高45.0%。理之律者装备时，触发极限闪避技能时，生成3只浮游炮，每只浮游炮对目标造成3*60.00%攻击力冰冻元素伤害</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">构造之理\t\t\t\t\t</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:20秒]构造阵列攻击敌人，造成3*600.0%攻击力的冰冻元素伤害，最后一击造成10点冻结积蓄值；使用后，角色造成的全伤害提高50.0%，持续7秒。理之律者使用时，主动技能会使敌人进入持续7秒的解析状态，自身在3秒内回复180点构造能量</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">万物解构</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">蓄力攻击和必杀技攻击全伤害提高30.0%。理之律者装备时，非骑乘状态下，蓄力攻击回复3.0点能量</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/180/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/07/91006211/75d78f817fe9bb792c7a8136d5856cd8_610329386191992786.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「真理之钥」图鉴后任意重炮蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2250%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%2